Peabody Trust intends to establish a Dynamic Market under the Procurement Act 2023 for the procurement of Works related contracts by Peabody Trust and other eligible contracting authorities.
Please head to www.procurepublic.co.uk/tenders to access the application form.
ProcurePublic Ltd acts as the procurement and managing agent for the Dynamic Market and will manage its establishment, supplier admission, administration and ongoing operation on behalf of Peabody Trust.
The Dynamic Market is intended to provide a flexible and compliant procurement route for a broad range of works associated with housing, property, construction, regeneration, asset management, maintenance, compliance, infrastructure and the wider public sector estate.
The Dynamic Market will be divided into individual categories (parts) to enable contracting authorities to identify suppliers appropriate to the nature, location, value and requirements of a particular procurement.
The Works Dynamic Market comprises 33 categories (W1-W33) covering physical works, repair, maintenance, installation, construction, enabling works, public realm, estate works, retrofit, temporary buildings and development delivery.
The Dynamic Market includes, but is not limited to:
W1 Planned Internal Refurbishment; 
W2 Planned External Fabric Works; 
W3 Roofing and Roofline Works; 
W4 Windows, Doors and Glazing; 
W5 Responsive Repairs; 
W6 Voids and Re-let Works; 
W7 Electrical Installation and Testing Works; 
W8 Gas, Heating and Domestic Hot Water Works; 
W9 Ventilation, Air Conditioning and Indoor Air Quality; 
W10 Lifts and Specialist Lifting Equipment; 
W11 Fire Safety and Passive Fire Protection Works; 
W12 Asbestos, Hazardous Materials and Decontamination Works; W13 Water Hygiene and Legionella Remedial Works; 
W14 Security, Access Control, CCTV and Door Entry; 
W15 External Civils, Drainage and Flood Works; 
W16 Highways, Footways, Surfacing and Public Realm; 
W17 Car Parks, Line Marking and Parking Infrastructure; 
W18 Grounds, Landscaping and External Amenity Works; 
