W20 Disabled Adaptations and Independent Living Works; 
W21 Damp, Mould, Condensation and Property Condition Works; W22 Decarbonisation and Whole-Building Retrofit; 
W23 District Heating, Heat Networks and Communal Energy; W24 EV Charging and Electrical Infrastructure; 
W25 New Build Housing and Residential Construction; 
